# Any copy of an env file, however it is suffixed — these are full copies,
# secrets and all. Neither `.env` nor `*.bak` matched `.env.bak.1786691251`,
# so those sat untracked and one `git add -A` away from being published.
.env.*
!.env.example
dashboard/.env.local*
*.pem
credentials.json

